    "title": "With Taylor Walls out, Ha-Seong Kim returns to regular work at shortstop - NewsBreak",
    "text": "WEST SACRAMENTO, Calif. — With Taylor Walls sidelined for at least 10 days with a left groin strain, Ha-Seong Kim will get the opportunity to do what he has done for most of his big-league career — play shortstop on an everyday basis. Given how eventful his first season with the Rays has been so far, Kim welcomes the return to normalcy. “As long as I’m healthy, of course, I want to play every day,” he said before Wednesday’s game via interpreter David Lee.",
